        "checksum": "d098455d1ac32866d3f6edac1fbb165801c89faccdab801f301941d7796fe160_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggCYqppM5pl_text": "<p>We are excited to be part of the FESPA Global Print Expo 2026 in Barcelona! During the exhibition, visitors can explore our popular models: F13, F13 Pro, and K13 Lite. A full range of consulting services and technical support will also be available. We warmly invite you to visit our booth to learn more about our products and services.</p>",
        "ggFEKTSjvb-_alt": "Expert Talks",
        "ggFEKTSjvb-_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/gempages_491413794182923290-9bff3071-9b4f-4da5-a54e-5f186ce34d75.jpg",
        "ggJpmuhR1og_text": "<a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/pages/our-brand-procolored  \" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#C53333;\">Procolored</span></a><span style=\"color:#C53333;\"> Introduction</span>",
        "ggLaIDJhkYz_text": "<p>The FESPA Global Print Expo 2026 is a premier gathering in the printing and visual communication industry. It will be held from May 19 to 22, 2026, at the&nbsp;Fira Barcelona Gran Via,&nbsp;Barcelona, Spain. More than 14,000 attendees from around the globe are anticipated, alongside a lineup of over 550 exhibitors representing more than 40 countries. From screen and digital printing to textile printing and signage, the event will put the industry’s newest technologies on display. Also on the agenda are hands-on demonstrations, industry expert talks, and contests such as the World Wrap Masters.&nbsp;It offers brands, manufacturers, designers, and print service providers a platform to share&nbsp;industry&nbsp;trends, find business opportunities, and explore&nbsp;technological&nbsp;innovations.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggNPvQ7IjaH_text": "<p>At the FESPA Expo, visitors to&nbsp;Procolored’s&nbsp;booth can watch a complete printing demo from design to finished product. They can feel the texture of DTF transfer samples and talk directly with technical staff about equipment and business advice. The booth will also provide details on limited-time discounts and startup packages. Our booth is No. 3-A61. We&nbsp;welcome everyone to visit and experience it in person.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggYJkt-u52W_alt": "Procolored's factory in China",
        "ggYJkt-u52W_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/gempages_491413794182923290-1c25f0b5-d878-4d7e-ad4d-c37731f65805.png",
        "gg_QPDuPaOQ_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#161723;\"><strong>Published:</strong></span> Tuesday, May 19, 2026</p>",
        "ggcDO1xIYYY_text": "<p>By Bella</p>",
        "ggd64BdUGTe_text": "<span style=\"color:#C53333;\">Procolored DTF Printers</span>",
        "ggdFt1_qaDe_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/gempages_491413794182923290-97d9474f-bfd2-418f-bd19-47c507355691.png",
        "ggjb6aMSure_text": "Meet Procolored at FESPA Global Print Expo 2026 in Barcelona",
        "ggm6jiLZ3rs_text": "<p>At this year’s expo,&nbsp;Procolored&nbsp;will&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;its best-selling models: F13, F13 Pro, and K13 Lite. All three operate on<strong> </strong>DTF technology and share a set of key advantages. First, the white ink circulation system automatically cycles white ink, preventing sedimentation and print head clogs for stable printing. Second, automatic cleaning and capping-station moisture maintenance keep the nozzles protected during downtime, reducing clogs and extending lifespan. Third, an infrared safety system stops the printer if the film warps or foreign objects are detected, avoiding costly damage. These features ensure a reliable, safe, and worry-free DTF printing experience across all models.&nbsp;Customers can choose the model that best fits their business needs.&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggoJAeSWJCr_alt": "Procolored's  popular printer K13 Lite and its printing works",
        "ggoJAeSWJCr_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/3454/6613/files/gempages_491413794182923290-d885bf7e-dc3a-47f5-886c-ea2a4bfd5ba4.jpg",
        "ggoJAeSWJCr_title": "Title",
        "ggwzpY6FF8g_text": "<span style=\"color:#C53333;\">FESPA Global Print Expo 2026</span>",
        "ggxdPyvi9DF_text": "<p><a href=\"https://www.procolored.com/pages/our-brand-procolored  \" target=\"_blank\"><strong><u>Procolored</u></strong></a>, founded in 2018, is located in LA and has its supply chain in China.&nbsp;The company develops compact, affordable, and easy-to-use digital printers for small businesses and individual entrepreneurs. Specializing in&nbsp;on-demand printing technologies—DTF, UV, UV DTF, and DTG—Procolored’s printers could print&nbsp;on a wide range of substrates, from fabric and wood to metal, ceramics, glass, and acrylic. With a presence in 58 countries and regions, its printers have supported more than 30,000 users in custom printing and flexible business ventures. By integrating research, development, and manufacturing, the company&nbsp;maintains&nbsp;control over both core algorithms and hardware, earning multiple patents in printing technology. This approach allows&nbsp;Procolored&nbsp;to&nbsp;rapidly&nbsp;improve its products and deliver stable, efficient, and easy-to-use digital printing solutions worldwide.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
